Optional. Meeting Completed (2050) reaches the same roles as the other meeting events.

Base: zan-workspace main at e845ae6. Independent of native-push.patch: apply either, both, in any order.
    git apply --check notification-rules-meeting-completed.patch
    git apply notification-rules-meeting-completed.patch

Today 2050 has no rule, so only the meeting's attendees get it. The rule comments name 2020 as
"Completed" and 2040 as "Rescheduled", which suggests 2050 was meant to be listed. 2020 is really
Rescheduled and 2040 is Missed (see interactionTypes.ts).

This changes the web too: Admin, Project Manager, Senior Blockchain Developer and BDE start getting
"Meeting with X completed" in the bell and as a browser push. Skip this patch if that is not wanted.
After applying, copy src/constants/notificationRules.ts to the phone again.

